RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:Refill check: medications and pill organizer
DESCRIPTION:• Count what's left of each medication\, and request refills 
 for anything under 10 days.\n• Refill the weekly pill organizer for the 
 week ahead.\n• Any new prescription\, dose change or stopped medicine th
 is month? Update the written list.\n\n—\nFrom DoseBeacon: Pill Reminder\
 , free on the App Store: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dosebeacon-pill-rem
 inder/id6796910918?pt=129123876&ct=cal-medication-refill-reminder-cal&mt=8
 \nAbout this calendar: https://honestlittleapps.github.io/calendars/medica
 tion-refill-reminder-calendar/
URL:https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dosebeacon-pill-reminder/id6796910918?pt=
 129123876&ct=cal-medication-refill-reminder-cal&mt=8
END:VEVENT
