TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=6
SUMMARY:Medicine cabinet clear-out
DESCRIPTION:Twice a year: check expiry dates\, and remove medicines you no 
 longer take. The FDA lists safe disposal options\, including drug take-bac
 k locations (many pharmacies have kiosks) and\, for some medicines\, house
 hold-trash or flush instructions on the label.\n\n—\nFrom DoseBeacon: Pi
 ll Reminder\, free on the App Store: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dosebea
 con-pill-reminder/id6796910918?pt=129123876&ct=cal-medication-refill-remin
 der-cal&mt=8\nAbout this calendar: https://honestlittleapps.github.io/cale
 ndars/medication-refill-reminder-calendar/
URL:https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dosebeacon-pill-reminder/id6796910918?pt=
 129123876&ct=cal-medication-refill-reminder-cal&mt=8
END:VEVENT
