TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=3
SUMMARY:Update the medication list for family and caregivers
DESCRIPTION:Every three months: make sure a current medication list (name\,
  dose\, time\, prescriber\, allergies) is somewhere family can find it\, l
 ike your phone's Medical ID\, the fridge door or a shared note.\n\n—\nFr
 om DoseBeacon: Pill Reminder\, free on the App Store: https://apps.apple.c
 om/us/app/dosebeacon-pill-reminder/id6796910918?pt=129123876&ct=cal-medica
 tion-refill-reminder-cal&mt=8\nAbout this calendar: https://honestlittleap
 ps.github.io/calendars/medication-refill-reminder-calendar/
URL:https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dosebeacon-pill-reminder/id6796910918?pt=
 129123876&ct=cal-medication-refill-reminder-cal&mt=8
