RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Ask the pharmacist: a medication review
DESCRIPTION:Once a year\, ask your pharmacist or doctor to review everythin
 g you take together\, including vitamins and over-the-counter items. Inter
 actions and duplicates are easy to miss when several prescribers are invol
 ved.\n\n—\nFrom DoseBeacon: Pill Reminder\, free on the App Store: https
 ://apps.apple.com/us/app/dosebeacon-pill-reminder/id6796910918?pt=12912387
 6&ct=cal-medication-refill-reminder-cal&mt=8\nAbout this calendar: https:/
 /honestlittleapps.github.io/calendars/medication-refill-reminder-calendar/
URL:https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dosebeacon-pill-reminder/id6796910918?pt=
 129123876&ct=cal-medication-refill-reminder-cal&mt=8
